  "result": "I've made three changes, but I haven't run the test suite or a type check, so none of it is verified.\n\n- **Removed members:** the usage service now listens for `member.removed` and lowers seat usage by one, so the billing page and plan checks see the freed seat immediately. The change is in `src/server/services/usage-service.ts`.\n- **Periodic recount:** the recount in `src/server/repositories/usage-repository.ts` now counts only active, non-archived members. Before, it counted every member row, including removed ones, so a recount would have brought the removed seats back.\n- **Revoked invitations:** `countPendingInvitations` in `src/server/repositories/invitation-repository.ts` now also excludes revoked invitations. This frees the seat when an invitation is revoked. It also fixes re-sending, because the replaced invitation no longer holds its seat when the new one is checked. A workspace that really is full is still refused.",
